        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "袋 counts bags or bagged quantities. The following noun identifies what the bag contains.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我买了一袋米。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le yī dài mǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I bought a bag of rice.",
